{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object is approached, then grab and process it, move if heavy, or approach if visible. list of available nodes: <Action ID = GrabObject    /> <Action ID = MoveToDestination    /> <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectHeavy    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectApproached    /> <SubTree ID = ProcessObjectTask    />",
